,{"text":"த்","lemma":"சந்தி","gloss":"sandhi consonant"}],"gloss":"sleep becoming difficult"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தெண்ணீர்","parts":[{"text":"தெள்","lemma":"தெளிவு","gloss":"clear"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"clear water"},{"surface":"நிகர்மலர்","parts":[{"text":"நிகர்","lemma":"நிகர்","gloss":"resembling"},{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"resembling flowers"},{"surface":"புரையும்","parts":[{"text":"புரையும்","lemma":"புரைதல்","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்மலர்","parts":[{"text":"நன்மலர்","lemma":"நன்மலர்","gloss":"beautiful flowers"}],"gloss":"beautiful flowers","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மழைக்கணிற்","parts":[{"text":"மழைக்கணிற்","lemma":"மழைக்கணிற்","gloss":"in the cool eyes"}],"gloss":"in the cool eyes","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கௌியவாற்","parts":[{"text":"கௌியவாற்","lemma":"கௌியவாற்","gloss":"indeed full of"}],"gloss":"indeed full of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பனியே","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"பனி","gloss":"tears"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"tears"}]}],"literal":"Forest mahua's summer white flowers / wind-beaten tall branches shedding, slipping from stems, / male-elephant-roaming narrow path to be covered, falling, / lofty mountain's difficult desert path he who traversed thinking of, / dense darkness midnight sleep difficult becoming, / clear water resembling-flower like / beautiful flower-like cool eyes in, are full of indeed, tears.","translation":"The white summer flowers of the forest mahua tree, shaken from tall branches by the beating wind, slip from their stems and fall, covering the narrow path where male elephants roam. Thinking of him who has traversed that difficult desert path amidst lofty mountains, sleep becomes impossible in the dense darkness of midnight, and tears well up in my cool, beautiful eyes that resemble blossoms in clear water.","modern":"காட்டு இழுப்பை மரத்தின் கோடைகாலத்து வெண்மையான பூக்கள், காற்று மோதியதால் உயர்ந்த கிளைகளிலிருந்து காம்புகள் கழன்று விழுந்து, ஆண் யானைகள் நடமாடும் குறுகிய வழியை மூடுமாறு பரவுகின்றன. உயர்ந்த மலைகளையுடைய அத்தகைய அரிய பாலைவன வழியைக் கடந்து சென்ற தலைவனை நினைத்து, அடர்ந்த இருள் நிறைந்த நள்ளிரவில் தூக்கம் வராமல் தவிக்கிறேன். தெளிந்த நீரில் மலர்ந்த மலர்களைப் போன்ற எனது குளிர்ந்த அழகிய கண்களில் கண்ணீர் பனித்துளிகள் போல நிறைந்துள்ளது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to herself or her confidante during her separation from the hero. The hero has journeyed through a harsh desert path (pālai) to acquire wealth. At midnight, unable to sleep in the dense darkness, she anxiously thinks of the dangers of his journey. The falling white mahua flowers, shaken by the wind and covering the narrow paths where wild elephants roam, vividly evoke the dry, desolate, and perilous nature of the desert landscape. Her eyes, which normally resemble fresh flowers blooming in clear water, are now filled with tears, contrasting her inner grief with the dry heat of the desert path he traverses.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.4],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[1.9,2.6],[2.6,3.1],[3.1,3.43],[3.43,4.0],[4.18,5.37],[5.37,5.59],[5.59,6.03],[6.03,6.7],[6.7,7.7],[7.7,8.4],[8.4,8.95],[8.95,9.3],[9.3,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[10.98,11.15],[11.15,11.63],[11.63,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,14.3],[14.3,14.8],[14.8,15.5],[15.5,15.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.1],[3.1,3.55],[3.55,4.07],[4.07,4.5],[4.5,5.35],[5.86,6.7],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,8.1],[8.1,8.7],[8.7,9.26],[9.26,9.7],[9.7,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,11.93],[11.93,12.4],[12.57,13.1],[13.1,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,15.1],[15.1,15.6],[15.6,16.2],[16.2,16.7]]}}